d: @BrendanPlayford 375 PAPER trades 41.1% win rate PF 1.38 ('still early'); @w1nklerr promo tweet ' to ,202' with an EVM address. This corroborates my own port's finding: realized gross edge ~0, so the only viable design is market-making where the venue spread exceeds cost (reference's spread > 2x fee rule), not Jev's predictions. Sources gathered directly because the librarian lane failed with 'Insufficient account funds'."
